v>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a>: 10,000 - 50,000 gp, <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20%28Continent%29\">Mainland</a>: 35 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">35 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">120 gp</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lightcolor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Light</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span><span style=\"margin: 0 0 0 0.4em;\">0 sqm</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">October 28, 1997<br/>Alpha 3.0</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20050601213919&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Magic_Light_Wand_7ff7c8.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a magic light wand <span class=\"p-duration\">that is brand-new</span>.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 15.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It is one of the only remaining Older Wands. Not used as much anymore since the Ambient Light update. This item is considered rare on <a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a>, because the only monster there that drops this item is the rare boss <a href=\"#/wiki/Apprentice%20Sheng\">Apprentice Sheng</a>.\nWhen it is lit, it will turn into a Magic Light Wand (Lit), provide 8 squares of white light, and look like this: <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Magic Light Wand (Lit)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Magic_Light_Wand_Lit_e248ee.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</p><p>Can be obtained through the <a href=\"#/quest/voodoo-doll-quest\">Voodoo Doll Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/the-desert-dungeon-quest\">The Desert Dungeon Quest</a> and the <a href=\"#/quest/orc-shaman-quest\">Orc Shaman Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Scarab\">Ancient Scarab</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Spawn%20of%20Morgathla\">Ancient Spawn of Morgathla</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Animated%20Mummy\">Animated Mummy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Apprentice%20Sheng\">Apprentice Sheng</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Broken%20Shaper\">Broken Shaper</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Geomancer\">Dwarf Geomancer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Elder%20Mummy\">Elder Mummy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghazbaran\">Ghazbaran</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Golgordan\">Golgordan</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grim%20Reaper\">Grim Reaper</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grynch%20Clan%20Goblin\">Grynch Clan Goblin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Latrivan\">Latrivan</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mad%20Scientist\">Mad Scientist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Madareth\">Madareth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mahatheb\">Mahatheb</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Memory%20of%20a%20Scarab\">Memory of a Scarab</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Merlkin\">Merlkin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Occultist\">Minotaur Occultist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Morgaroth\">Morgaroth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mummy\">Mummy